    "The Widmark factor is typically around 0.68 for men and 0.55 for women. If yours is far from that, it is worth checking the values above." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Widmark factor is typically around 0.68 for men and 0.55 for women. If yours is far from that, it is worth checking the values above."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Widmark-faktor tipikusan 0,68 körül van férfiaknál és 0,55 körül nőknél. Ha a tiéd messze esik ettől, érdemes ellenőrizni a fenti adatokat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app tells you when it expects you to clear. If you are reliably back to normal well before that, your rate is higher than the setting — nudge it up a step and watch for a few sessions. If it takes longer than predicted, nudge it down." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app tells you when it expects you to clear. If you are reliably back to normal well before that, your rate is higher than the setting — nudge it up a step and watch for a few sessions. If it takes longer than predicted, nudge it down."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az app megmondja, mikorra várja a kiürülést. Ha ennél jóval hamarabb vagy rendben, a lebontásod gyorsabb a beállítottnál — vidd feljebb egy lépéssel, és figyeld néhány alkalmon át. Ha tovább tart, vidd lejjebb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spread suggested by your drinking frequency is ± %@ per hour." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The spread suggested by your drinking frequency is ± %@ per hour."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A fogyasztási gyakoriságod alapján javasolt szórás ± %@ óránként."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their own limit and the finer settings can be changed later on the Profile tab, while they are the selected person." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Their own limit and the finer settings can be changed later on the Profile tab, while they are the selected person."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A saját határ és a finomabb beállítások később a Profil fülön módosíthatók, amíg ő a kiválasztott személy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an estimate, not a measurement." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is an estimate, not a measurement."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ez egy becslés, nem mérés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how we estimate your elimination rate. Regular drinking induces the liver's CYP2E1 pathway, so frequent drinkers clear alcohol faster. It is the weakest point of the model, which is why you can set under Advanced how much of that uncertainty the app shows you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is how we estimate your elimination rate. Regular drinking induces the liver's CYP2E1 pathway, so frequent drinkers clear alcohol faster. It is the weakest point of the model, which is why you can set under Advanced how much of that uncertainty the app shows you."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ebből becsüljük a lebontási sebességet. A rendszeres fogyasztás indukálja a máj CYP2E1 útvonalát, ezért a gyakori fogyasztók gyorsabban bontják le az alkoholt. Ez a modell leggyengébb pontja, ezért a Haladó beállításokban megadhatod, mennyit mutasson meg az app ebből a bizonytalanságból."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This might cross your limit" : {
